<opsproc code="00028049.0001001" revdate="2024-07-22T17:03:27"><title>Reactive Windshear Detection Function</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00028049.0001001.001"><title>Flight Preparation/Limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00028049.0001001.002"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00028049.0001001.003"><para code="00028049.0001001.001" layer="1" lid="N.00028049.0001001.004">The flight crew must ensure
